# wger's own submodule — docker-compose.yml's `include:` references it
# directly from the filesystem (not copied into our image at all), and
# this directory alone is sizable (a full git checkout of its own repo)
# — excluding it keeps house-simulator-server's own build context small
# and fast, same as every other thing above that our Dockerfile never
# actually needs inside its own image.
wger
